## 6. Preserved stack, ops, security (do not dilute)

### Stack (`jobbeagle-core-stack`)

- Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, TypeScript 5, Tailwind
- Supabase (Auth Google OAuth, Postgres, RLS, Storage)
- Gemini `@google/genai` — models in `constants/models.ts`
- Lemon Squeezy only (never Stripe)
- Extension MV3 `browser-extension/`
- Domain: https://www.jobbeagle.com
- Credits: free **3 lifetime Snapshot**; Guide starts at 0. Subs: Standard **100 Snapshot + 5 Guide** / Advanced **300 Snapshot + 15 Guide** (`constants/checkout-plans.ts`)
- Secrets: never ship service-role / Gemini / LS keys to client

### Security (`jobbeagle-enterprise-security`)

Rate limit analyze + extension-capture; LS webhook HMAC + idempotency; PII/resume handling; RLS; CCPA hard delete; extension scrape safety.

### Ops (`agent-runs-ops` + `git-github-vercel-always`)

Agent runs scripts / push / sync; user only OAuth, Chrome extension reload, manual QA. Meaningful code changes → commit + push `main` unless user forbids.

### Samples (`jobbeagle-report-samples`)

Any report format/content change updates **both** fixtures in `lib/sample-reports.ts` in the same PR/commit.

### Launch (`jobbeagle-product-focus`)

Do not submit Chrome Web Store until user explicitly says launch; remind then.

