## 7. Code style (preserved)

- Match existing file patterns; minimal diffs; no drive-by refactors.
- TypeScript strictness as in repo; prefer existing libs (`lib/gemini-analyze.ts`, `lib/normalize-lite-report.ts`, `constants/*`).
- No unnecessary markdown/docs unless asked.
- User-facing report copy: English product UI for Snapshot/Guide dashboards unless locale already wired.

